{"seq":1,"slug":"trajectory-rna-velocity-model","title":"轨迹推断与 RNA 速率动力学模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/single-cell-spatial-transcriptomics-analysis/trajectory-integration-atlas/trajectory-rna-velocity-model","wordCount":2533,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"轨迹推断与-rna-速率动力学模型\">轨迹推断与 RNA 速率动力学模型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-发育时间不是测出来的量-而是推断的隐变量\">核心概念：发育时间不是测出来的量，而是推断的隐变量</h2><p>单细胞实验破坏性地裂解细胞，拿到的是某一瞬间每个细胞的转录本快照。发育生物学真正想回答的问题——「这群细胞按什么顺序分化、谁是祖细胞、谁已终末分化、某个基因在哪个转折点被打开」——在快照里并没有直接对应的列。轨迹推断（trajectory inference）做的就是把这个缺失的<strong>时间轴</strong>补出来，而补法有两条根本不同的路线：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>几何路线</strong>：假设细胞在表达空间中沿一条（或一棵）连续流形分布，用距离定义「谁离起点更近」。这是伪时间（pseudotime）的思路，只用到表达谱的<strong>静态坐标</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>动力学路线</strong>：利用基因表达内部的时间信号——未剪接（unspliced）与已剪接（spliced）mRNA 的比例关系本身携带方向，因为转录激活后未剪接前体会先积累，随后才转成成熟转录本。这就是 RNA 速率（RNA velocity）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>两条路线的信息论地位不同。伪时间给的是一个<strong>标量排序</strong>，方向靠外部假设（根细胞、拓扑）注入；RNA 速率试图从每个细胞的数据里直接读出<strong>方向向量</strong>，代价是它的估计依赖剪接动力学的近似，噪声极大。2026 年的实践共识是：不要二选一，而是把速率作为一种「方向先验」融进马尔可夫模型，再用伪时间或实验时间点交叉验证——这正是 CellRank 2 的设计。</p>\n<p>本章的定位是：它假定你已经有了干净的 count matrix（见 <a href=\"../singlecell-assay-data-model/expression-matrix-data-structure\">表达矩阵的数据结构</a>）和归一化后的表达空间（见 <a href=\"../preprocessing-annotation-pipeline/normalization-hvg-model\">归一化与高变基因建模</a>），讨论如何从那里走到「谁分化成谁」。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"速率的第一性原理-一个两室剪接模型\">速率的第一性原理：一个两室剪接模型</h2><p>RNA 速率的全部数学来自一个极简的动力学假设。设某基因在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的未剪接转录本数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、已剪接数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，转录速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，剪接速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span>，成熟 mRNA 降解速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{du}{dt} = \\alpha(t) - \\beta\\,u(t), \\qquad \\frac{ds}{dt} = \\beta\\,u(t) - \\gamma\\,s(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个方程式就是 La Manno 等人提出 velocyto 时的起点（La Manno et al., <em>Nature</em>, 2018）。关键观察：<strong>在稳态下</strong>，未剪接与已剪接量满足线性关系，把两式联立消去 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>u</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{ds}{dt} = \\beta\\,u - \\gamma\\,s = v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>也就是说，只要能估出每个细胞的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，就能对每个基因算出一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>，从而得到一个基因维度的速率向量。把它投影到低维嵌入上，就得到每个细胞的运动方向。</p>\n<p>对瞬时状态，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 并非常数（基因在分化中被开/关），因此 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 的关系会偏离稳态直线，形成相位图（phase portrait）中的闭合环或曲线。scVelo 的贡献正是把这种偏离建模出来：<strong>稳态模型</strong>只用极端分位数回归估 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>β</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\beta/\\gamma)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 比值，把速率定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 相对稳态线的残差；<strong>随机模型</strong>进一步引入转录脉冲（bursting）的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 分布；<strong>动力学模型</strong>则用期望最大化（EM）逐基因拟合完整的 ODE，允许 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 随伪时间变化（Bergen et al., <em>Nature Biotechnology</em>, 2020；scVelo 文档 <a href=\"https://scvelo.readthedocs.io）。三者逐级更贵、更依赖数据质量。\">https://scvelo.readthedocs.io）。三者逐级更贵、更依赖数据质量。</a></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[cellranger 输出: spliced / unspliced 计数] --&gt; B[归一化 + 高变基因]&#10;    B --&gt; C{速率模型选择}&#10;    C --&gt;|快, 只估比值| D[稳态模型]&#10;    C --&gt;|允许转录脉冲| E[随机模型]&#10;    C --&gt;|逐基因拟合 ODE + EM| F[动力学模型]&#10;    D --&gt; G[每细胞 x 每基因 速率向量 v]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[投影到 UMAP/PCA 得方向场]&#10;    H --&gt; I[作为方向先验进入 CellRank 马尔可夫人模型]\">graph TD\n    A[cellranger 输出: spliced / unspliced 计数] --&gt; B[归一化 + 高变基因]\n    B --&gt; C{速率模型选择}\n    C --&gt;|快, 只估比值| D[稳态模型]\n    C --&gt;|允许转录脉冲| E[随机模型]\n    C --&gt;|逐基因拟合 ODE + EM| F[动力学模型]\n    D --&gt; G[每细胞 x 每基因 速率向量 v]\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[投影到 UMAP/PCA 得方向场]\n    H --&gt; I[作为方向先验进入 CellRank 马尔可夫人模型]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>核心假设</th>\n<th>参数量/基因</th>\n<th>计算成本</th>\n<th>何时用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>稳态（steady-state）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 恒定，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u,s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 在稳态线上</td>\n<td>1（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta/\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 比值）</td>\n<td>极低，秒级</td>\n<td>快速探索、基因数多</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机（stochastic）</td>\n<td>引入转录脉冲的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 二阶矩</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>存在明显 bursting 的基因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动力学（dynamical，EM）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 分段变化，拟合全 ODE</td>\n<td>4–5（含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{switch}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>高，分钟–小时</td>\n<td>需精细相位图、方向可靠性要求高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代谢标记（labeling）</td>\n<td>用 4sU 标记直接测新转录本</td>\n<td>结合标记比例</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>有代谢标记实验时最可靠</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"从速率向量到命运概率-cellrank-的马尔可夫状态建模\">从速率向量到命运概率：CellRank 的马尔可夫状态建模</h2><p>一个原始速率向量本身很脆弱：个别基因的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u/s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 噪声会让方向在邻域内乱指。CellRank 2 的做法是不直接信速率，而是把它变成<strong>细胞间转移矩阵的一个方向性偏置</strong>（Weiler et al., <em>Nature Methods</em>, 2024；文档 <a href=\"https://cellrank.readthedocs.io）。\">https://cellrank.readthedocs.io）。</a></p>\n<p>框架由两层组成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>方向核（kernel）</strong>：给出「从细胞 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 转移到细胞 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span>」的倾向。CellRank 2 内置 <code>VelocityKernel</code>（用 RNA 速率）、<code>ConnectivityKernel</code>（纯表达邻接）、<code>PseudotimeKernel</code>（外部伪时间）、<code>CytoTRACEKernel</code>（干性打分，Gulati et al., <em>Science</em>, 2020）、<code>RealTimeKernel</code>（实验时间点）、<code>PrecomputedKernel</code>。多个核可以相乘融合，例如把速率的局部方向感和伪时间的全局单调性结合。</li>\n<li><strong>马尔可夫状态估计器</strong>：主推 <code>GPCCA</code>（后端为 pyGPCCA 的广义谱聚类），也提供 <code>CFLARE</code>。它在转移矩阵上识别初态宏状态（macrostate）、终态宏状态和中间态，并计算每个细胞到每个终态的<strong>吸收概率（absorption probability）</strong>——这就是「命运概率」（fate probability）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>吸收概率的价值在于输出是<strong>有概率语义的连续量</strong>：一个祖细胞可能有 0.7 的概率走向 A 谱系、0.3 走向 B，而不是被硬分到某一个簇。此外 CellRank 能对每个终态做 driver gene 排序，并给出基因表达沿伪时间的趋势（内置 GAM / GAMR / sklearn 模型）。这条链路把「速率」从一张箭头图升级成了可统计检验的谱系承诺估计。</p>\n<p>一个必须强调的边界：CellRank 的可靠性上限由输入核决定。如果 <code>VelocityKernel</code> 建在质量差的动力学模型上，GPCCA 只是把噪声平滑了一下，不会产生真相——所以上游的基因过滤与模型选择仍是主导因素。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"拓扑式轨迹推断-当速率不可用或不可信时\">拓扑式轨迹推断：当速率不可用或不可信时</h2><p>并非所有数据都适合 RNA 速率。空间转录组、甲醛固定样本、smart-seq 全长文库、跨物种整合后的图谱，常常没有可靠的 unspliced 层（这类平台差异见 <a href=\"../singlecell-assay-data-model/singlecell-platform-chemistry\">单细胞测序平台与液滴文库化学</a>）。此时回到几何路线，用<strong>图/树结构</strong>刻画分化拓扑：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>拓扑假设</th>\n<th>算法骨架</th>\n<th>典型输出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Monocle3</td>\n<td>可分支的轨迹图</td>\n<td>预处理后学习 principal graph，再在图上算伪时间</td>\n<td>分支树 + 伪时间（Cao et al., <em>Nature</em>, 2019）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Slingshot</td>\n<td>一组线性谱系</td>\n<td>在细胞簇上建最小生成树（MST），再对每条 lineage 拟合平滑曲线</td>\n<td>多条 lineage 的伪时间（Street et al., <em>BMC Genomics</em>, 2018）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Palantir</td>\n<td>连续分支</td>\n<td>扩散图（diffusion map）上构建吸收马尔可夫链，用吸收时间当伪时间</td>\n<td>分支概率 + 伪时间（Setty et al., <em>Nature Biotechnology</em>, 2019）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PAGA</td>\n<td>粗粒化连通图</td>\n<td>把细胞簇当作节点，用簇间连接数建图，节点边权反映连通强度</td>\n<td>簇级拓扑图（Wolf et al., <em>Genome Biology</em>, 2019）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践中的组合拳是 <strong>PAGA 定拓扑 + 伪时间定顺序</strong>：先用 PAGA 图看有没有分支、分几支，再用 Monocle3 或 Palantir 在图上打伪时间。PAGA 的图本身不含方向，所以必须外接一个根细胞假设，或者接 CellRank 的方向核。若要在伪时间上做差异表达，tradeSeq 提供了负二项 GAM 框架来检验「沿谱系变化的基因」（Van den Berge et al., <em>Nature Communications</em>, 2020）。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"方法选择-先问数据有什么-再选工具\">方法选择：先问数据有什么，再选工具</h2><p>选错的成本很高，因为轨迹结论一旦写进论文就很难撤回。决策应从前置条件出发，而不是从工具流行度出发：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>有未剪接层、且是发育/重编程体系</strong> → RNA 速率 + CellRank 2。若同一体系有 scATAC，可用 MultiVelo 把染色质可及性纳入速率模型（Li et al., <em>Nature Biotechnology</em>, 2023），或直接用 VeloVI 这类深度模型提升跨基因泛化（Liang et al., 2024）。</li>\n<li><strong>有代谢标记（4sU / scEU-seq）</strong> → 优先用 dynamo 做速率或直接算标记比例（Qiu et al., <em>Cell</em>, 2022）；此时 <code>RealTimeKernel</code> 比 <code>VelocityKernel</code> 更贴近实验真相。</li>\n<li><strong>无未剪接层、只有表达谱</strong> → 几何路线（Monocle3 / Slingshot / Palantir），方向靠根细胞假设注入。</li>\n<li><strong>跨样本/跨平台整合后的图谱</strong> → 先做整合再做轨迹，且要用 <code>PseudotimeKernel</code> 或 <code>ConnectivityKernel</code>，因为整合常常抹平了真实的剪接差异。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三个反复出现的陷阱：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>把 UMAP 上的箭头当真</strong>。速率向量的可视化会被 UMAP 的非线性形变左右，同一份速率在不同随机种子下箭头可完全不同。判断方向可靠性应看相位图和跨种子一致性，而不是单张图。</li>\n<li><strong>用速率给整合后的数据定方向</strong>。批次校正算法（Harmony、scVI 等）的目标恰恰是最小化样本间差异，其中就包含真实的剪接动力学差异。</li>\n<li><strong>忽视 cell cycle 与双细胞</strong>。增殖细胞的周期性基因会制造与分化无关的「速率」，而多重液滴在质量报告里若未剔除，会在轨迹上形成假的中间态（相关 QC 见 <a href=\"../singlecell-assay-data-model/quality-control-batch-diagnosis\">质量控制与批次诊断</a>）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>一句话总结工程判据：<strong>轨迹结果必须能被两条独立证据交叉支持</strong>——例如 RNA 速率指出的方向同时被实验时间点（RealTimeKernel）或已知 marker 的表达顺序印证。任何只由单一方法支撑的谱系承诺，都应当标注为待验证的假设，而不是结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>本章把「谁分化成谁」拆成三条可操作的工程决策：速率模型（稳态 / 随机 / 动力学）解决方向从哪来，CellRank 的核 + GPCCA 把方向转成有概率语义的命运概率，几何路线（Monocle3 / Slingshot / Palantir / PAGA）在没有未剪接层时兜底。选型的起点应当是数据本身有什么层（unspliced、代谢标记、实验时间点），而不是工具热度。判据始终是：单一方法给出的谱系方向只是假设，只有被第二条独立证据印证的轨迹才值得写进结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"轨迹推断与 RNA 速率动力学模型","id":"轨迹推断与-rna-速率动力学模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：发育时间不是测出来的量，而是推断的隐变量","id":"核心概念-发育时间不是测出来的量-而是推断的隐变量"},{"level":2,"text":"速率的第一性原理：一个两室剪接模型","id":"速率的第一性原理-一个两室剪接模型"},{"level":2,"text":"从速率向量到命运概率：CellRank 的马尔可夫状态建模","id":"从速率向量到命运概率-cellrank-的马尔可夫状态建模"},{"level":2,"text":"拓扑式轨迹推断：当速率不可用或不可信时","id":"拓扑式轨迹推断-当速率不可用或不可信时"},{"level":2,"text":"方法选择：先问数据有什么，再选工具","id":"方法选择-先问数据有什么-再选工具"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"细胞类型注释与标记基因校验实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/single-cell-spatial-transcriptomics-analysis/preprocessing-annotation-pipeline/cell-annotation-workflow"},"next":{"title":"多样本整合与批次矫正方法机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/single-cell-spatial-transcriptomics-analysis/trajectory-integration-atlas/multi-sample-integration-methods"}}